IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. RETCODE.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 RC PIC 99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY "ENTER RETURN CODE:"
    ACCEPT RC

    EVALUATE RC
        WHEN 0
            DISPLAY "SUCCESS"

        WHEN 4
            DISPLAY "WARNING"

        WHEN OTHER
            DISPLAY "FAILURE"
    END-EVALUATE.

    STOP RUN.
